  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial stable release of Ragom.Toolkit.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures included:\n\t\t\t- Reusable extension methods\n\t\t\t- Safe type conversion extensions\n\t\t\t- Date and time utilities\n\t\t\t- String formatting and validation helpers\n\t\t\t- File and URL utilities\n\t\t\t- Dynamic SQL models and DbHelper utilities\n\t\t\t- INSERT, UPDATE, UPSERT database operations\n\t\t\t- Generic object mapping for SQL queries\n\t\t\t- ExecuteDataTable, ExecuteDataSet, and ExecuteScalar helpers\n\t\t\t- SQL injection-safe parameter handling\n\t\t\t- AES and symmetric encryption utilities\n\t\t\t- Secure OTP generation\n\t\t\t- HTTP service utilities\n\t\t\t- Number-to-word conversion utilities\n\t\t\t- Enum and Guid conversion helpers\n\t\t\t- Nullable and DBNull-safe parsing utilities\n\t\t\t- Multi-target support for .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8, and .NET 10",
